	(text "MOTOR 2: 12S / 60 A CONTINUOUS CELL\nLocal STM32G431: 3 leg shunts + DC-input shunt, sampled every PWM cycle.\nCommand/arm/status are isolated; DGND never bonds to this cell's BATN."
